# A copy copies the copiable values (CR 707.2), and Changeling (CR 702.73a) is one of them: Phyrexian Metamorph entering
# as a copy of Firdoch Core is a Kindred Artifact - Shapeshifter and every creature type, as the Core is. Bot1 casts
# the Core on turn 1 (Sol Ring and a Swamp) and the Metamorph on turn 3 (Mox Sapphire's {U}, Sol Ring and Mox Jet).
# Other artifacts could be copied, so the Core is chosen by name.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Firdoch Core
Phyrexian Metamorph
Mox Ruby
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

